  "id": "psychic-mind-crush",
  "name": "Mind Crush",
  "description": "The caster focuses and ripples of warped space pulse from their hand; a shimmering link reaches out and seizes the target in a pink bubble of force that lifts debris around it while the air ripples and warps. Then the caster clenches: the bubble collapses inward and crushes the target with a burst of light and a cracking of the ground.",
