        "to": 1.0,
        "flicker_hz": 5
      },
      "intent": "The target is held in a shimmering bubble. A glyph turns under it, debris and motes float up off the ground, and ripples of warped air pulse around it and tighten. In a game the target is lifted off its feet here."
    },
    {
      "id": "crush",
      "phase": "impact",
      "start_ms": 1400,
      "end_ms": 1500,
      "intensity": {
        "shape": "spike",
        "from": 1.0,
        "to": 0.9
      },
      "intent": "The caster clenches: the bubble collapses onto the target in a flash, a ring of force bursts out across the ground and the ground cracks under it. Hold a frame on the squeeze."
    },
    {
      "id": "aftershock",
